ext-gen-zhenwu-v900-ai-chip-offers-more-on-package-memory-than-nvidia-h200-outlines-plans-to-deploy-20-gw-of-compute-and-teases-4-10-trillion-parameters-for-upcoming-qwen-mod</link><description>阿里巴巴现在声称即将推出的真武 V900 芯片将拥有 216GB 封装内存，预计于 2027 年第一季度正式发布。我们只能推测 V900 将利用长鑫存储的 HBM3E 解决方案，特别是考虑到他们的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/alibaba-brags-that-its-next-gen-zhenwu-v900-ai-chip-offers-more-on-package-memory-than-nvidia-h200-outlines-plans-to-deploy-20-gw-of-compute-and-teases-4-10-trillion-parameters-for-upcoming-qwen-mod.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 14:57:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/alibaba-brags-that-its-next-gen-zhenwu-v900-ai-chip-offers-more-on-package-memory-than-nvidia-h200-outlines-plans-to-deploy-20-gw-of-compute-and-teases-4-10-trillion-parameters-for-upcoming-qwen-mod</guid></item><item><title>同类最大的数据集可以阐明大质量恒星如何塑造早期星系</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/largest-dataset-of-its-kind-could-clarify-how-massive-stars-shaped-early-galaxies</link><description>天文学家对宇宙最早的星系了解得越多，它们就显得越陌生。它们的许多令人惊讶的特性可以用它们的大质量恒星与我们银河系等星系中的恒星之间的差异来解释。犹他大学领导的哈勃太空望远镜进行的一项新调查正在揭示早期星系中运行的恒星天体物理学。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/largest-dataset-of-its-kind-could-clarify-how-massive-stars-shaped-early-galaxies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 14:42:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/largest-dataset-of-its-kind-could-clarify-how-massive-stars-shaped-early-galaxies</guid></item><item><title>癌症相关的 DNA 变化可能在诊断前几年就出现在血液中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-related-dna-changes-may-appear-in-blood-years-before-diagnosis</link><description>研究人员发现，诊断前收集的全基因组血浆 cfDNA 甲基化谱包含与未来前列腺癌和乳腺癌相关的早期分子特征，其中前列腺沉默子甲基化提供了更强的风险分层。丰胸剂信号较弱，并且因亚型和疾病阶段而异，表明 cfDNA 甲基化对于风险评估和监测可能比作为独立的诊断测试具有更大的价值。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cancer-related-dna-changes-may-appear-in-blood-years-before-diagnosis.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 14:27:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-related-dna-changes-may-appear-in-blood-years-before-diagnosis</guid></item><item><title>一系列反应揭示了复杂的碳化学如何在寒冷的空间中开始</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/series-of-reactions-reveals-how-complex-carbon-chemistry-can-begin-in-frigid-space</link><description>在地球出现之前，就有了化学。在恒星和行星诞生的难以想象的寒冷、乌黑的云层中，碳分子组装成更复杂的形式——开始化学之旅，最终将生命的一些基本成分传递给年轻的行星。只有一个问题：这些分子需要热量才能形成。至少科学家们长期以来一直这么认为。但佛罗里达国际大学化学家亚历山大·梅贝尔的新研究表明，这种化学反应实际上可以在接近绝对零的温度下发生，即−460°F（−273°C）。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/series-of-reactions-reveals-how-complex-carbon-chemistry-can-begin-in-frigid-space.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 14:12:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/series-of-reactions-reveals-how-complex-carbon-chemistry-can-begin-in-frigid-space</guid></item><item><title>当粒子分裂时会发生什么？ |徐岑科 (UCSB)</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/what-happens-when-a-particle-breaks-apart-cenke-xu-ucsb</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:57:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/what-happens-when-a-particle-breaks-apart-cenke-xu-ucsb</guid></item><item><title>摸草？当 AMD 将这些消耗硬件的灌木丛和树木的光线追踪内存使用量减少 98% 时，情况就不同了</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/touch-grass-not-when-amd-has-whittled-down-ray-tracing-memory-usage-by-98-for-these-hardware-sapping-bushes-and-trees</link><description>我不需要再出去了。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/touch-grass-not-when-amd-has-whittled-down-ray-tracing-memory-usage-by-98-for-these-hardware-sapping-bushes-and-trees2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:42:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/touch-grass-not-when-amd-has-whittled-down-ray-tracing-memory-usage-by-98-for-these-hardware-sapping-bushes-and-trees</guid></item><item><title>实现旋转链</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/realizing-a-spin-chain</link><description>研究人员通过用有机磁性分子组装晶体，获得了具有里程碑意义的模型磁体的丰富物理知识。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/realizing-a-spin-chain2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:27:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/realizing-a-spin-chain</guid></item></channel></rss>